    "detailed_description": "Who are you. Where is this place.<br>Find the secret in a rainbow-colored, monochrome world. <br>Maybe this is all someone's dream.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > About the game</h2>This game is a 2d exploratory adventure game. Move through the various monochromatic worlds and solve many puzzles and quizzes.<br>At the end of it you will know all the secrets!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics of the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Solve several puzzles in a monochrome world.<br></li><li>A game made up of pixel art only.<br></li><li>A simple game with only basic moves and investigations (conversations).<br></li><li>Get various items from various NPCs while playing the game.<br></li><li>Game save is 'only once'. It's like our lives, right?</li></ul>",
